      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This started after the most recent update 11/13/24, I could go to a world and videos would load, I could put on a video. After the video finished is when I started having these issues, I can't put on any video. Any world I go to with a Provideo player or IwaSync player they both do the same thing. I can play twitch links with the stream option and videos from newgrounds work but Youtube videos, and Youtube streams are erroring now. I have cleared my cache, uninstalled and reinstalled, have tried the beta and non beta versions and this issue persists.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
